WEBVTT

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:32.209
[Full-Time Magister 2]

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:35.542
♪ The rising dawn
cuts through the night ♪

00:00:35.751 --> 00:00:38.460
♪ And destroys the darkness ♪

00:00:38.542 --> 00:00:42.542
♪ A new wing shall emerge ♪

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.167
♪ And soar through the sky ♪

00:00:47.015 --> 00:00:50.357
♪ Smoke appears in
conflicted dimensions ♪

00:00:50.669 --> 00:00:53.307
♪ Waiting for someone's arrival ♪

00:00:53.689 --> 00:00:58.234
♪ Protecting the unshakable
belief within us ♪

00:00:58.474 --> 00:01:00.372
♪ And never backs down ♪

00:01:01.007 --> 00:01:04.871
♪ The sacred fountain lays there ♪

00:01:05.312 --> 00:01:08.633
♪ Shocked by what appeared
in front of us ♪

00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:12.065
♪ The star atlas has open
a path for our journey ♪

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:15.505
♪ Laughing while we watch
the world from above ♪

00:01:15.938 --> 00:01:19.040
♪ He had given me everything ♪

00:01:19.134 --> 00:01:23.218
♪ The truth in sight is unpleasant ♪

00:01:23.258 --> 00:01:25.980
♪ Anger that is insurmountable ♪

00:01:25.981 --> 00:01:30.389
♪ That unique soul
was born to be a hero ♪

00:01:30.532 --> 00:01:33.659
♪ The torrential rain can't be
stopped by the hot-blooded ♪

00:01:33.699 --> 00:01:37.584
♪ The chosen one will not
bid farewell easily ♪

00:01:37.606 --> 00:01:40.449
♪ I will create a miracle ♪

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:45.986
♪ With the burning fire
in my wounded heart ♪

00:01:46.193 --> 00:01:50.284
♪ I promise ♪

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:07.830
There are so many monsters.

00:02:09.542 --> 00:02:12.334
If this goes on, we will lose
Xuefeng Mountain.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.918
One member of the 4th Patrol Squad...

00:02:20.966 --> 00:02:23.259
that patrolled outside came back alive.

00:02:23.617 --> 00:02:26.110
There is someone
who came back alive? Great.

00:02:26.408 --> 00:02:27.715
Take good care of him.

00:02:28.369 --> 00:02:30.316
Without their signal to warn us,

00:02:30.717 --> 00:02:34.037
we would probably be unaware
that disaster is incoming.

00:02:34.949 --> 00:02:37.335
But, according to this survivor,

00:02:37.667 --> 00:02:42.376
the Light Talent mage in their team
could send four complete signals.

00:02:43.246 --> 00:02:45.246
However, he was killed by an Archwolf.

00:02:45.637 --> 00:02:47.637
At last, he sent out two signals.

00:02:48.293 --> 00:02:50.471
What? An Archwolf?

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:52.463
Is he sure that it wasn't
an One-eyed Wolf Demon?

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:56.940
He was sure that
it was a pet Archwolf...

00:02:57.192 --> 00:02:58.352
instead of One-eyed Wolf Demon.

00:03:00.028 --> 00:03:01.441
In our army,

00:03:01.645 --> 00:03:04.751
there is only probably one person
who has an Archwolf.

00:03:24.927 --> 00:03:25.980
Mr. Mu.

00:03:26.169 --> 00:03:29.458
Now, the refugees are flooding in.
It's chaotic out there.

00:03:30.764 --> 00:03:32.430
We are short-handed.

00:03:32.816 --> 00:03:35.547
-Please rest here for a while.
-Got it.

00:03:35.587 --> 00:03:37.845
Later on, arrange an
acceptable room for us...

00:03:37.871 --> 00:03:40.595
-so my daughter can rest well.
-Yes, we will.

00:03:42.584 --> 00:03:46.626
I heard many people from
Sky Magic High School is coming here.

00:03:46.834 --> 00:03:47.541
Is that true?

00:03:48.013 --> 00:03:51.053
But, I have no idea what dangers
they will encounter on the way here.

00:03:51.607 --> 00:03:54.934
So many people are heading here?
The route is important.

00:03:55.938 --> 00:03:57.941
If they entered an area filled
with monsters accidentally,

00:03:58.109 --> 00:03:59.803
the consequences will be horrible.

00:04:00.766 --> 00:04:01.620
Yes.

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:03.643
Sky Magic High School?

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.890
Mo Fan? Zhang Xiaohou?

00:04:06.429 --> 00:04:07.482
I have to go and help them!

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:10.093
-Ningxue!
-Dad!

00:04:10.146 --> 00:04:11.786
There are many people
who need help outside.

00:04:12.559 --> 00:04:14.399
It's in code blood now.

00:04:14.639 --> 00:04:17.932
A whole army may even die outside.

00:04:18.594 --> 00:04:20.474
What can you do alone?

00:04:20.976 --> 00:04:23.309
It's better than staying here
and doing nothing.

00:04:26.501 --> 00:04:29.543
You're my only daughter.
I won't let you be in danger.

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:32.596
Watch her.

00:04:32.902 --> 00:04:34.155
Without my permission,

00:04:34.375 --> 00:04:35.868
don't let her leave.

00:04:47.952 --> 00:04:49.498
There's really something wrong with you.

00:04:51.263 --> 00:04:53.263
You're not as foolish as the others.

00:04:53.403 --> 00:04:54.736
On the way here,

00:04:54.959 --> 00:04:59.626
many fools didn't even realise
that I was the one who killed them.

00:05:03.725 --> 00:05:04.725
What a scoundrel.

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:06.103
Don't come here.

00:05:09.759 --> 00:05:10.972
Don't worry.

00:05:11.177 --> 00:05:12.724
I'm not interested in them.

00:05:13.028 --> 00:05:16.079
Mo Fan, as long as you hand me
the Sacred Spring,

00:05:16.183 --> 00:05:18.131
I'll spare your life.

00:05:18.901 --> 00:05:20.434
You're from the Black Curia.

00:05:22.498 --> 00:05:24.138
I can't help but be curious.

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:27.583
Why did you suspect me?

00:05:28.252 --> 00:05:30.158
I'm your instructor.

00:05:31.051 --> 00:05:33.519
At first, during our training lesson...

00:05:45.473 --> 00:05:46.579
They killed it.

00:05:47.296 --> 00:05:49.563
To be exact, Mo Fan killed it.

00:05:49.616 --> 00:05:51.109
What? Dead?

00:05:53.607 --> 00:05:54.460
The Black Curia...

00:05:54.584 --> 00:05:57.376
created the Violent Spring
which is similar to the Sacred Spring.

00:05:58.006 --> 00:05:59.272
The Violent Spring?

00:06:00.140 --> 00:06:03.020
It makes monsters...
violent and manic.

00:06:06.579 --> 00:06:08.326
It's fine you're not saying.

00:06:09.053 --> 00:06:10.880
If I kill you,

00:06:11.083 --> 00:06:13.643
the Sacred Spring will be mine.

00:06:14.422 --> 00:06:17.478
But, you're naughty.

00:06:21.434 --> 00:06:24.663
I killed one of your Archwolves,
of course I can kill the second one.

00:06:37.521 --> 00:06:39.421
It's the Black Beasts? Be careful!

00:06:41.576 --> 00:06:43.763
You have time to worry about others?

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:55.527
Brother Fan!

00:06:57.566 --> 00:06:58.353
Xiaohou!

00:07:04.901 --> 00:07:06.308
Wind...

00:07:06.982 --> 00:07:08.022
It's too late.

00:07:08.244 --> 00:07:09.430
Am I dead?

00:07:09.602 --> 00:07:11.375
The beast moves his claws fast.

00:07:11.428 --> 00:07:12.762
I don't feel any pain.

00:07:23.205 --> 00:07:23.704
He...

00:07:24.738 --> 00:07:25.724
He Yu?

00:07:38.326 --> 00:07:39.352
He Yu?

00:07:44.016 --> 00:07:44.856
Creeping Ice!

00:07:50.651 --> 00:07:51.918
Flowing Earth!

00:07:53.146 --> 00:07:54.680
Hiss of Fire, Burn!

00:08:03.777 --> 00:08:05.214
Hiss of Fire, Explode!

00:08:13.013 --> 00:08:14.056
Xiaohou.

00:08:14.661 --> 00:08:16.354
He Yu, you'll be fine.

00:08:16.355 --> 00:08:17.462
You'll be fine!

00:08:19.308 --> 00:08:20.228
I...

00:08:20.454 --> 00:08:21.716
I did it.

00:08:23.706 --> 00:08:25.639
You're the first person...

00:08:26.357 --> 00:08:27.675
I protected...

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:29.837
using magic.

00:08:30.301 --> 00:08:33.431
Why did you protect me?
You should protect yourself.

00:08:35.756 --> 00:08:38.418
Because you're very...

00:08:39.638 --> 00:08:41.078
Very important.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:46.817
He Yu!

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:54.040
While you can't move,

00:08:54.242 --> 00:08:57.709
the number of casualties among
your friends are increasing,

00:09:07.334 --> 00:09:09.418
One, two, three, four...

00:09:09.556 --> 00:09:11.610
five, six, seven.

00:09:24.342 --> 00:09:26.089
Hahaha...

00:09:26.116 --> 00:09:29.950
Looks like you improved a little bit.

00:09:38.274 --> 00:09:39.167
I have been...

00:09:39.570 --> 00:09:42.474
beside this kind of person...

00:09:43.568 --> 00:09:46.171
I could teach you more.

00:09:46.667 --> 00:09:50.917
But today, I think I can only give you
the last lesson of your life.

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:53.917
I think you've already learnt it,

00:09:54.339 --> 00:09:57.099
that is not to trust others easily.

00:09:58.334 --> 00:09:59.174
Mo Fan.

00:09:59.626 --> 00:10:01.573
This lesson is interesting, right?

00:10:02.321 --> 00:10:03.574
Don't tell me...

00:10:03.817 --> 00:10:06.961
you want me to kill all your friends...

00:10:07.521 --> 00:10:09.681
before you're willing to hand me
the Sacred Spring?

00:10:11.914 --> 00:10:13.032
Thunder Magic...

00:10:23.554 --> 00:10:25.194
This is the Sacred Spring
that you wanted.

00:10:26.577 --> 00:10:29.445
Finally you've come to understand.

00:10:30.115 --> 00:10:30.768
Mo Fan!

00:10:31.741 --> 00:10:33.043
Yes, come on.

00:10:33.217 --> 00:10:36.420
-Give it to me.
-You really want it that much?

00:10:37.219 --> 00:10:38.139
Quick, give it to me!

00:10:43.937 --> 00:10:45.004
What are you doing?

00:11:04.511 --> 00:11:05.271
You...

00:11:05.337 --> 00:11:07.105
How dare you do that?

00:11:11.305 --> 00:11:14.456
If you want the Sacred Spring,
you'll have to try and kill me.

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:18.180
Kill you?

00:11:18.856 --> 00:11:20.496
Great.

00:11:20.627 --> 00:11:23.093
I'll cut you open!

00:11:27.396 --> 00:11:29.850
A year ago, I killed something like you.

00:11:30.108 --> 00:11:32.548
Today, killing you is
like killing a dog!

00:11:33.122 --> 00:11:35.758
Roaring Thunder!

00:11:46.071 --> 00:11:48.416
You upgraded your ability quickly.

00:11:48.736 --> 00:11:51.256
But, do you think
you can compete with me?

00:11:51.443 --> 00:11:52.750
Such a fool.

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:05.584
If that Archwolf recovers,
I'll be doomed.

00:12:06.313 --> 00:12:07.207
We have to go and help him.

00:12:07.501 --> 00:12:10.043
But, Mo Fan can't even defeat
this opponent.

00:12:10.174 --> 00:12:13.397
As long as we can buy time for Mo Fan,
he can get a chance to use his magic.

00:12:13.699 --> 00:12:17.459
Although the beasts are quick,
our magic can hinder their movements.

00:12:17.586 --> 00:12:19.267
Okay, I'll stall that one.

00:12:19.357 --> 00:12:20.717
You can help to stall the other one.

00:12:22.141 --> 00:12:23.487
Congealing Ice!

00:12:24.908 --> 00:12:26.295
Hiss of Fire, Burn!

00:12:32.493 --> 00:12:35.373
Ignore them as they are useless.
Kill Mo Fan for me!

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:42.857
Hiss of Fire, Cremation!

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:48.517
Hiss of Fire, Cremation!

00:12:58.138 --> 00:12:59.565
Level two of Hiss of Fire, Cremation...

00:12:59.697 --> 00:13:02.471
can make the fire on the opponent...

00:13:02.662 --> 00:13:04.115
more intense.

00:13:04.754 --> 00:13:06.620
The Hiss of Fire added by Zhou Min...

00:13:06.792 --> 00:13:09.543
can burn the Black Beast until it dies.

00:13:21.818 --> 00:13:22.511
Zhou Min!

00:13:26.078 --> 00:13:28.567
Oh no, the beast has recovered.

00:13:28.834 --> 00:13:31.001
The Thunder Magic can
only stop it for a short time.

00:13:31.694 --> 00:13:36.036
I'll end the fight with you dregs.

00:14:02.772 --> 00:14:07.451
If we go against a mage with pets,
if we can avoid his pets and kill him,

00:14:08.021 --> 00:14:10.261
his pets will also disappear.

00:14:11.849 --> 00:14:14.502
I didn't expect Instructor Bai Yang
to be a scoundrel.

00:14:15.464 --> 00:14:18.644
I won't let him hurt my students again!

00:14:23.166 --> 00:14:24.526
It's all over now.

00:14:24.715 --> 00:14:25.621
Mo Fan.

00:14:27.585 --> 00:14:29.331
Blinding Radiance!

00:14:31.962 --> 00:14:34.120
Roaring Thunder!

00:14:40.755 --> 00:14:41.502
You...

00:14:41.894 --> 00:14:43.121
How dare you...

00:14:44.375 --> 00:14:48.042
Do you think I'm foolish enough
to stand here and be attacked by you?

00:14:48.176 --> 00:14:51.834
This scoundrel hid a Black Beast
to protect himself.

00:14:52.152 --> 00:14:53.645
Save your energy.

00:14:53.918 --> 00:14:55.710
You're full of theories only.

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:59.340
You're a useless high school teacher
without any combat ability.

00:14:59.977 --> 00:15:01.083
Don't look down on me.

00:15:01.721 --> 00:15:04.388
I'll purify your beasts!

00:15:04.944 --> 00:15:06.144
Blinding Radiance!

00:15:11.391 --> 00:15:12.871
What a fool.

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:16.397
Black Beasts are cursed.

00:15:16.776 --> 00:15:19.483
Your Blinding Radiance
doesn't work on them.

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:23.377
Don't be impatient.

00:15:23.798 --> 00:15:26.531
I'll kill you one by one.

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:29.380
Black Ice Sword!

00:15:45.514 --> 00:15:48.109
Why did that happen?

00:15:49.081 --> 00:15:49.961
Mu Bai!

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:27.707
He Yu.

00:16:34.715 --> 00:16:36.035
He Yu.

00:16:39.174 --> 00:16:43.068
He Yu!

00:17:00.126 --> 00:17:02.501
♪ Pressing onward courageously ♪

00:17:03.204 --> 00:17:06.614
♪ With the burning dreams in our heart ♪

00:17:06.884 --> 00:17:09.935
♪ We are reminiscing
the dreams of our past ♪

00:17:10.576 --> 00:17:12.056
♪ And it gives me strength ♪

00:17:12.457 --> 00:17:14.350
♪ The most stubborn wings ♪

00:17:14.964 --> 00:17:18.010
♪ Dreamt that we will not
wander anymore ♪

00:17:18.342 --> 00:17:22.267
♪ And hoped that we will
fly further one day ♪

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:27.665
♪ With the dim lights
shining through the sky ♪

00:17:28.658 --> 00:17:33.605
♪ Shine through our heart
and fill in the ups and downs ♪

00:17:34.666 --> 00:17:37.927
♪ I'm as proud as the sun ♪

00:17:38.239 --> 00:17:41.093
♪ The clouds are moving
in the distance ♪

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:43.685
♪ Since I have decided to be unique ♪

00:17:43.828 --> 00:17:46.736
♪ I will break all barriers
and shine through ♪

00:17:47.061 --> 00:17:49.783
♪ Life is ever-changing ♪

00:17:49.918 --> 00:17:53.335
♪ But I will soar through the sky ♪

00:17:53.661 --> 00:17:55.630
♪ The hope that is beating within me ♪

00:17:56.202 --> 00:17:59.299
♪ Writes a new chapter for me ♪

00:17:59.844 --> 00:18:03.683
♪ We will battle once more
if we have the chance ♪

00:18:04.271 --> 00:18:10.508
♪ To be the everlasting light
in the world ♪
